<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#7048e8"/><meta name="description" content="Pusat langganan akun digital premium terpercaya. Canva Pro, Netflix, Spotify, CapCut Pro murah dan bergaransi full. Pembayaran QRIS otomatis realtime."/><title>tokosans. — Akses Akun Digital Premium Legal & Murah | Pengiriman Instan</title><link rel="canonical" href={siteUrl}/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content={siteUrl}/><meta property="og:title" content="tokosans. — Akses Akun Digital Premium Legal & Murah"/><meta property="og:description" content="Pusat langganan akun digital premium terpercaya. Proses instan 24/7, QRIS otomatis, garansi penuh."/><meta property="og:image" content={`${siteUrl}/og-image.png`}/><meta property="og:site_name" content="tokosans."/><meta property="og:locale" content="id_ID"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="tokosans. — Akses Akun Digital Premium Legal & Murah"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Pusat langganan akun digital premium terpercaya. Proses otomatis instan, QRIS realtime, garansi penuh."/><meta name="twitter:image" content={`${siteUrl}/og-image.png`}/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16.png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/favicon-180.png"/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(organizationSchema)} /><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(websiteSchema)} /><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemListSchema)} /><style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');
:root{--ink:#1e142e;--muted:#6f647d;--v:#7048e8;--v-dark:#5932d2;--l:#f1ecfe;--line:#e8e1f2;--bg:#faf8ff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
.shell{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.2vw,2.75rem);line-height:1.18;margin:10px 0}
.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;transition:all .2s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)}

.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% -20%,rgba(112,72,232,0.12) 0%,rgba(250,248,255,0) 70%),linear-gradient(135deg,#fcfaff 0%,#f3edff 100%)}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(#7048e80d 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:28px 28px;pointer-events:none}
.hero-grid{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;min-height:500px;padding:60px 0 80px}
.eyebrow,.kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 14px;color:var(--v);background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfd4fa;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(112,72,232,0.06)}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#10b981;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #10b98122;animation:pulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.2)}}
h1{margin:20px 0 16px;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.5vw,4rem);line-height:1.06;color:#180e29}
h1 em{color:var(--v);font-style:normal;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7048e8,#4c1d95);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
.lead{max-width:540px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.68}
.actions{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:28px}
.button{padding:13px 24px;font-size:.95rem}
.primary{color:#fff;background:var(--v);box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(112,72,232,0.3)}
.primary:hover{background:var(--v-dark);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(112,72,232,0.4)}
.secondary{border:1px solid #dcd3f0;color:var(--ink);background:#ffffffd4;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
.secondary:hover{border-color:var(--v);color:var(--v);transform:translateY(-2px);background:#fff}
.trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;margin-top:30px;color:#5a4f6e;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700}
.trust span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.check-icon{width:14px;height:14px;color:#10b981;flex-shrink:0}

.preview-wrapper{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto}
.preview{position:relative;padding:26px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.9);border-radius:24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(78,40,148,0.14);transition:all .3s ease;z-index:2}
.preview:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(78,40,148,0.18)}
.preview-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0e8ff}
.preview-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;color:#059669;background:#ecfdf5;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid #a7f3d0}
.preview-title{color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem}
.payment{padding:20px;border-radius:18px;background:#f9f6ff;border:1px solid #e8dbff}
.acc-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;color:#047857;background:#d1fae5;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
.prod-title{font:800 1.25rem 'Plus Jakarta Sans';margin:0 0 4px;color:#180e29}
.prod-sub{font-size:.84rem;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
.preview-box{padding:14px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5d8fb;font-size:.84rem;color:#3b2d54;line-height:1.55;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(112,72,232,0.06)}

/* Floating Animated Logo Images */
.floating-logo{
  position:absolute;
  z-index:10;
  width:38px;
  height:38px;
  border-radius:10px;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(78,40,148,0.18);
  transition:transform .3s ease;
  pointer-events:none;
}
.floating-logo img{
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  object-fit:cover;
  display:block;
}

.floating-logo-canva{top:-18px;left:-20px;animation:floatSlow 4.5s ease-in-out infinite}
.floating-logo-netflix{top:20px;right:-22px;animation:floatAlt 5s ease-in-out infinite 0.7s}
.floating-logo-capcut{bottom:28px;left:-22px;animation:floatSlow 4.8s ease-in-out infinite 1.4s}
.floating-logo-chatgpt{bottom:-18px;right:-18px;animation:floatAlt 4.2s ease-in-out infinite 2.1s}

@keyframes floatSlow{
  0%,100%{transform:translateY(0px) rotate(0deg)}
  50%{transform:translateY(-12px) rotate(3deg)}
}
@keyframes floatAlt{
  0%,100%{transform:translateY(0px) rotate(0deg)}
  50%{transform:translateY(-14px) rotate(-3deg)}
}

.section{padding:80px 0}
.soft{background:#f6f3fc}
.section-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:32px}
.kicker{border:0;background:var(--l);color:var(--v)}
.copy{max-width:420px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}

/* Categories Filter Bar */
.category-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:20px 0 32px}
.category-filter{border:1px solid #e2d8f7;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 16px;background:#fff;color:var(--muted);font:600 .84rem 'DM Sans';cursor:pointer;transition:all .18s;white-space:nowrap}
.category-filter.active,.category-filter:hover{background:var(--v);border-color:var(--v);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(112,72,232,0.25)}

/* Product Catalog Grid */
.catalog{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 1fr);gap:18px}
.card{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #eee8f8;border-radius:18px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),box-shadow .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(112,72,232,0.12);border-color:#d7c7fe}
.card-link{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%}

/* Card Header */
.card-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.app-icon{width:50px;height:50px;min-width:50px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden}
.app-icon img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px}
.app-icon-fallback{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--v);background:var(--l);width:100%;height:100%;display:grid;place-items:center}
.card-title-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;min-width:0;flex:1}
.card-title{margin:0;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:#180e29;line-height:1.3;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;min-height:2.6em}
.card-rating{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:.76rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:600}
.card-rating .star{color:#f59e0b;font-size:.84rem}

/* Card Badges */
.card-badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:14px}
.badge-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2}
.badge-blue{background:#eff6ff;color:#2563eb}
.badge-green{background:#ecfdf5;color:#059669}
.info-icon{opacity:.75}

/* Card Price */
.card-price-section{margin-top:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid #f5f2fb}
.original-price{font-size:.78rem;color:#94a3b8;text-decoration:line-through;font-weight:500}
.price-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.current-price{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.discount-badge{background:#fffbeb;color:#b45309;border:1px solid #fef3c7;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px}

/* Center Proof & Other Sections */
.center{text-align:center}
.center p{max-width:640px;margin:14px auto;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
.proof-logos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px;max-width:880px;margin:38px auto 0}
.proof-logo{display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:72px;border:1px solid #e8e1f2;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;color:#7c7090;font:800 .82rem 'Plus Jakarta Sans';box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.02)}
.benefits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:40px}
.benefit,.review{border:1px solid #e8e1f2;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.02)}
.benefit h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.05rem;color:#180e29}
.benefit p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:42px}
.step{padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #e8e1f2}
.step-number{color:var(--v);font:800 .82rem 'Plus Jakarta Sans';background:var(--l);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-block}
.step h3{margin:12px 0 6px;font-size:1.15rem;color:#180e29}
.step p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;font-size:.88rem}
.reviews{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.review-tag{display:inline-block;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#ecfdf5;color:#059669;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
.review blockquote{min-height:50px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#392e4a;line-height:1.58;font-size:.9rem;font-style:normal}
.reviewer{color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}
.reviewer b{display:block;color:#180e29}
.faq{max-width:780px;margin:38px auto 0}
.faq details{margin:10px 0;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e1f2;overflow:hidden}
.faq summary{position:relative;padding:18px 48px 18px 20px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:#180e29;list-style:none;font-size:.95rem}
.faq summary:after{content:'+';position:absolute;right:20px;color:var(--v);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700}
.faq details[open] summary:after{content:'−'}
.faq p{margin:0;padding:0 20px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.65}

@media(max-width:1080px){
  .catalog{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .benefits,.reviews{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}

@media(max-width:860px){
  .shell{padding:0 18px}
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:40px 0 54px;gap:32px}
  .preview-wrapper{max-width:400px}
  .floating-logo-canva{left:-10px;top:-14px}
  .floating-logo-netflix{right:-12px;top:10px}
  .floating-logo-capcut{left:-12px;bottom:14px}
  .floating-logo-chatgpt{right:-10px;bottom:-14px}
  .section{padding:60px 0}
  .section-top{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}
  .copy{max-width:100%}
  .catalog{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}
  .proof-logos{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}
  .step{padding-top:16px}
}

@media(max-width:640px){
  .category-nav{
    flex-wrap:nowrap;
    overflow-x:auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
    margin:14px -18px 24px;
    padding:4px 18px 10px;
    scrollbar-width:none;
  }
  .category-nav::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  .catalog{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
  .card{padding:16px;border-radius:16px}
  .card:active{transform:scale(0.99)}
  .card-header{gap:14px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .app-icon{width:52px;height:52px;min-width:52px;border-radius:14px}
  .app-icon-fallback{font-size:1.25rem}
  .card-title{font-size:1.02rem;min-height:auto;-webkit-line-clamp:unset;line-height:1.3}
  .card-rating{font-size:.8rem}
  .card-badges{gap:6px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .badge-pill{font-size:.74rem;padding:3px 8px}
  .card-price-section{padding-top:10px}
  .current-price{font-size:1.18rem}
  .original-price{font-size:.8rem}
  .discount-badge{font-size:.72rem;padding:2px 7px}
  
  .actions{flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
  .actions .button{width:100%}
  .trust{gap:12px;font-size:.76rem}
  .floating-logo{display:none}
  .preview{padding:20px;border-radius:18px}
  .payment{padding:16px}
  .benefits,.reviews{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
  .proof-logos{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
  .faq details{margin:8px 0}
  .faq summary{padding:15px 42px 15px 16px;font-size:.9rem}
  .faq p{padding:0 16px 16px;font-size:.86rem}
}
</style></head><body>
<Header activeNav="home" />
<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><i class="dot"></i> Akses Premium &amp; Pengiriman Instan</span>
        <h1>Layanan digital<br/><em>tanpa ribet.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Dapatkan akses resmi akun aplikasi digital favoritmu untuk produktivitas, desain, dan hiburan. Diproses otomatis realtime, bergaransi penuh, dan kredensial langsung terkirim ke email &amp; layar.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="#produk">Lihat koleksi</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="#cara-kerja">Cara kerjanya</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust">
          <span><svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg> Pengiriman Instan</span>
          <span><svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg> Garansi Full Duration</span>
          <span><svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg> Akun Langsung Aktif</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-wrapper">
        <div class="floating-logo floating-logo-canva">
          <img src="/canva.webp" alt="Canva" />
        </div>
        <div class="floating-logo floating-logo-netflix">
          <img src="/netflix.webp" alt="Netflix" />
        </div>
        <div class="floating-logo floating-logo-capcut">
          <img src="/capcut.webp" alt="CapCut" />
        </div>
        <div class="floating-logo floating-logo-chatgpt">
          <img src="/chatgpt.webp" alt="ChatGPT" />
        </div>
        <aside class="preview">
          <div class="preview-head">
            <span class="preview-status"><i class="dot"></i> Otomatis Realtime</span>
            <span class="preview-title">Akun Langsung Aktif</span>
          </div>
          <div class="payment">
            <span class="acc-tag">Siap Digunakan</span>
            <h4 class="prod-title">Produk Pro &middot; 1 Bulan</h4>
            <p class="prod-sub">Akses fitur premium lengkap &amp; garansi penuh</p>
            <div class="preview-box">Akun dikirim otomatis &amp; muncul langsung di layar setelah pembayaran.</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="produk" class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-top">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Koleksi pilihan</span>
        <h2>Temukan yang kamu butuhkan.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="copy">Pilih layanan favoritmu, lanjutkan ke checkout, dan dapatkan detail akun dalam satu alur cepat.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="category-nav" aria-label="Filter kategori">
      <button class="category-filter active" type="button" data-category="all">Semua</button>
      {categories.map((category) => <button class="category-filter" type="button" data-category={category}>{category}</button>)}
    </div>

    <div class="catalog">
      {products.map((product) => {
        const origPrice = product.original_price && product.original_price > product.price ? product.original_price : null;
        const discountPct = origPrice ? Math.round(((origPrice - product.price) / origPrice) * 100) : null;
        return (
          <article class="card" data-category={product.category}>
            <a href={`/checkout?product=${product.id}`} class="card-link" aria-label={product.name}>
              <div class="card-header">
                <div class="app-icon">
                  {productImages[product.id] ? (
                    <img src={productImages[product.id]} alt={product.name} loading="lazy" />
                  ) : (
                    <div class="app-icon-fallback">{product.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase()}</div>
                  )}
                </div>
                <div class="card-title-group">
                  <h3 class="card-title">{product.name}</h3>
                  <div class="card-rating">
                    <span class="star">★</span>
                    <span>{seededRating(product.id)}{soldCounts[product.id] ? ` · Terjual ${formatSold(soldCounts[product.id])}` : ''}</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="card-badges">
                <span class="badge-pill badge-blue">
                  Ready
                  <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="10" height="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="badge-pill badge-green">
                  Garansi
                  <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="10" height="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg>
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="card-price-section">
                {origPrice && <div class="original-price">{formatRupiah(origPrice)}</div>}
                <div class="price-row">
                  <span class="current-price">{formatRupiah(product.price)}</span>
                  {discountPct !== null && <span class="discount-badge">-{discountPct}%</span>}
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>
        );
      })}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section center">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="kicker">Dibuat untuk kebutuhan harian</span>
    <h2>Satu etalase, banyak kemungkinan.</h2>
    <p>Dari tugas kreatif hingga waktu santai, pilih akses digital yang relevan dengan aktivitasmu tanpa berpindah-pindah tempat.</p>
    <div class="proof-logos">
      <div class="proof-logo">CREATIVE</div>
      <div class="proof-logo">STREAM+</div>
      <div class="proof-logo">FOCUS LAB</div>
      <div class="proof-logo">PLAY TIME</div>
      <div class="proof-logo">DAILY TOOLS</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="manfaat" class="section soft">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="kicker">Kenapa tokosans.</span>
      <h2>Belanja digital yang terasa lebih tenang.</h2>
      <p>Kami merancang pengalaman pemesanan yang ringkas, informatif, dan mudah diikuti dari awal sampai akhir.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="benefits">
      {benefits.map(([title,description]) => (
        <article class="benefit">
          <h3>{title}</h3>
          <p>{description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="cara-kerja" class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="kicker">Alur pesanan</span>
    <h2>Tiga langkah, langsung beres.</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="step">
        <span class="step-number">01</span>
        <h3>Temukan paketmu</h3>
        <p>Jelajahi produk digital favoritmu, lalu pilih durasi langganan yang sesuai kebutuhan.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <span class="step-number">02</span>
        <h3>Pembayaran Kilat</h3>
        <p>Lengkapi checkout dan gunakan QRIS dari aplikasi m-banking atau e-wallet mana saja.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <span class="step-number">03</span>
        <h3>Akun Langsung Aktif</h3>
        <p>Kredensial akun langsung ditampilkan di layar dan dikirimkan otomatis ke email kamu.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section soft">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-top">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Cerita pelanggan</span>
        <h2>Ringkas, jelas, dan mudah diikuti.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="copy">Pengalaman yang ingin kami hadirkan di setiap proses pemesanan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reviews">
      <article class="review">
        <div class="review-tag">Transaksi Terverifikasi</div>
        <blockquote>&ldquo;Checkout-nya gampang dipahami dan akun langsung siap pakai tanpa nunggu lama.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <div class="reviewer"><b>Nadia A.</b>Pengguna layanan kreatif</div>
      </article>
      <article class="review">
        <div class="review-tag">Transaksi Terverifikasi</div>
        <blockquote>&ldquo;Saya suka karena detail akun dikirim juga ke email, jadi bisa dicek kapan aja.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <div class="reviewer"><b>Raka P.</b>Pengguna layanan streaming</div>
      </article>
      <article class="review">
        <div class="review-tag">Transaksi Terverifikasi</div>
        <blockquote>&ldquo;Alurnya singkat, dari pilih paket sampai penerimaan akun terasa rapi dan cepat.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <div class="reviewer"><b>Salsa M.</b>Pengguna layanan produktivitas</div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="kicker">Pusat bantuan</span>
      <h2>Pertanyaan yang sering ditanyakan.</h2>
      <p>Temukan jawaban singkat sebelum membuat pesanan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      {faqs.map(([question,answer]) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{question}</summary>
          <p>{answer}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
<Footer />
<RecentSalesToast />
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.category-filter').forEach((button) => {
    button.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const category = (button as HTMLElement).dataset.category;
      document.querySelectorAll('.category-filter').forEach((item) => item.classList.toggle('active', item === button));
      document.querySelectorAll('.catalog .card').forEach((card) => {
        (card as HTMLElement).hidden = category !== 'all' && (card as HTMLElement).dataset.category !== category;
      });
    });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
